standard Go HTTP server.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:12.390
We set up our routes, we then
configure the server, we then

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:15.199
tell it to do the
listen and serve loop.

00:20:15.199 --> 00:20:17.240
The only thing that's new
